english translation text:
You know that I stood with truth;
you know that I am one who sacrifices himself;
you know that I belong to Karbala.
Lift my body from here and take me with you.

This grave is not my true resting place;
my sustenance and water are now there.
That place has become my home;
take me either to Najaf or Nainawa.

I will come walking upon my head today;
my intention is to travel to Samarra.
I will go to Khurasan, Najaf and Karbala;
take me to the place where Paradise lies.

O "Abad", Karbala is my Paradise;
love of the pure family lives within my dust.
I desire nothing besides them;
take me towards the shelter of Ahl al-Kisa.
